  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "speech_start_frame": 12,
      "speech_end_frame": 912,
      "end_frame": 921,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "Flip on a light, and a cockroach bolts for the crack under a closed door.",
          "v4_start_f": 24,
          "v4_end_f": 172,
          "abs_start_f": 12,
          "abs_end_f": 145
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "Standing up, it's half an inch tall.",
          "v4_start_f": 172,
          "v4_end_f": 251,
          "abs_start_f": 145,
          "abs_end_f": 214
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "That gap ahead is barely as thick as two stacked pennies.",
          "v4_start_f": 251,
          "v4_end_f": 376,
          "abs_start_f": 214,
          "abs_end_f": 330
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "It doesn't slow down.",
          "v4_start_f": 376,
          "v4_end_f": 422,
          "abs_start_f": 330,
          "abs_end_f": 373
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "Its head dips in.",
          "v4_start_f": 422,
          "v4_end_f": 471,
          "abs_start_f": 373,
          "abs_end_f": 418
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "Its back flattens.",
          "v4_start_f": 471,
          "v4_end_f": 521,
          "abs_start_f": 418,
          "abs_end_f": 464
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "And in under a second, it's gone.",
          "v4_start_f": 521,
          "v4_end_f": 596,
          "abs_start_f": 464,
          "abs_end_f": 538
        },
        {
          "idx": 8,
          "text": "Wait a second.",
          "v4_start_f": 596,
          "v4_end_f": 633,
          "abs_start_f": 538,
          "abs_end_f": 572
        },
        {
          "idx": 9,
          "text": "An insect's shell is supposed to be stiff armor.",
          "v4_start_f": 633,
          "v4_end_f": 738,
          "abs_start_f": 572,
          "abs_end_f": 671
        },
        {
          "idx": 10,
          "text": "Squashed that flat, its feet can't even stand underneath it.",
          "v4_start_f": 738,
          "v4_end_f": 854,
          "abs_start_f": 671,
          "abs_end_f": 777
        },
        {
          "idx": 11,
          "text": "So how does stiff armor fold in half, and what pushes it through?",
          "v4_start_f": 854,
          "v4_end_f": 1002,
          "abs_start_f": 777,
          "abs_end_f": 912
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "start_frame": 921,
      "speech_start_frame": 925,
      "speech_end_frame": 2278,
      "end_frame": 2288,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "At real speed, your eyes miss almost everything.",
          "v4_start_f": 1080,
          "v4_end_f": 1173,
          "abs_start_f": 925,
          "abs_end_f": 1015
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "So researchers filmed American cockroaches at five hundred frames per second.",
          "v4_start_f": 1173,
          "v4_end_f": 1315,
          "abs_start_f": 1015,
          "abs_end_f": 1153
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "Getting through wasn't one smooth slide.",
          "v4_start_f": 1315,
          "v4_end_f": 1391,
          "abs_start_f": 1153,
          "abs_end_f": 1224
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "It took five separate moves.",
          "v4_start_f": 1391,
          "v4_end_f": 1472,
          "abs_start_f": 1224,
          "abs_end_f": 1300
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "First, the antennae sweep the slot.",
          "v4_start_f": 1472,
          "v4_end_f": 1538,
          "abs_start_f": 1300,
          "abs_end_f": 1362
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "Next, the head tips down and wedges in.",
          "v4_start_f": 1538,
          "v4_end_f": 1638,
          "abs_start_f": 1362,
          "abs_end_f": 1459
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "Then the shield behind the head rolls slightly to slip inside.",
          "v4_start_f": 1638,
          "v4_end_f": 1767,
          "abs_start_f": 1459,
          "abs_end_f": 1583
        },
        {
          "idx": 8,
          "text": "Meanwhile, the back legs stay planted outside and shove the chest through.",
          "v4_start_f": 1767,
          "v4_end_f": 1913,
          "abs_start_f": 1583,
          "abs_end_f": 1726
        },
        {
          "idx": 9,
          "text": "Only at the end does the flattened belly pull clear.",
          "v4_start_f": 1913,
          "v4_end_f": 2007,
          "abs_start_f": 1726,
          "abs_end_f": 1819
        },
        {
          "idx": 10,
          "text": "Watch the back plates during that squeeze.",
          "v4_start_f": 2007,
          "v4_end_f": 2078,
          "abs_start_f": 1819,
          "abs_end_f": 1888
        },
        {
          "idx": 11,
          "text": "The shell isn't bending like soft rubber.",
          "v4_start_f": 2078,
          "v4_end_f": 2158,
          "abs_start_f": 1888,
          "abs_end_f": 1964
        },
        {
          "idx": 12,
          "text": "Instead, stiff plates overlap like roof tiles.",
          "v4_start_f": 2158,
          "v4_end_f": 2274,
          "abs_start_f": 1964,
          "abs_end_f": 2072
        },
        {
          "idx": 13,
          "text": "Soft hinge tissue between those plates folds nearly in half.",
          "v4_start_f": 2274,
          "v4_end_f": 2404,
          "abs_start_f": 2072,
          "abs_end_f": 2198
        },
        {
          "idx": 14,
          "text": "The body flattens without cracking a single plate.",
          "v4_start_f": 2404,
          "v4_end_f": 2490,
          "abs_start_f": 2198,
          "abs_end_f": 2278
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
      "start_frame": 2288,
      "speech_start_frame": 2292,
      "speech_end_frame": 3598,
      "end_frame": 3607,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "Still, a doorway is only half the puzzle.",
          "v4_start_f": 2586,
          "v4_end_f": 2672,
          "abs_start_f": 2292,
          "abs_end_f": 2367
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "Outside that slot, the back legs had room to push.",
          "v4_start_f": 2672,
          "v4_end_f": 2786,
          "abs_start_f": 2367,
          "abs_end_f": 2467
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "What happens when the whole ceiling stays low, with nowhere to stand?",
          "v4_start_f": 2786,
          "v4_end_f": 2922,
          "abs_start_f": 2467,
          "abs_end_f": 2592
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "In the lab, cockroaches raced down a low corridor.",
          "v4_start_f": 2922,
          "v4_end_f": 3025,
          "abs_start_f": 2592,
          "abs_end_f": 2693
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "Step by step, researchers dropped the roof closer to the floor.",
          "v4_start_f": 3025,
          "v4_end_f": 3153,
          "abs_start_f": 2693,
          "abs_end_f": 2818
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "Cut the height in half, right onto its back, and you'd expect it to slow down.",
          "v4_start_f": 3153,
          "v4_end_f": 3314,
          "abs_start_f": 2818,
          "abs_end_f": 2961
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "It didn't.",
          "v4_start_f": 3314,
          "v4_end_f": 3344,
          "abs_start_f": 2961,
          "abs_end_f": 2986
        },
        {
          "idx": 8,
          "text": "Down to half its standing height, the cockroach ran at nearly full speed.",
          "v4_start_f": 3344,
          "v4_end_f": 3490,
          "abs_start_f": 2986,
          "abs_end_f": 3124
        },
        {
          "idx": 9,
          "text": "Its legs simply splayed wider, keeping the same fast beat on every stride.",
          "v4_start_f": 3490,
          "v4_end_f": 3662,
          "abs_start_f": 3124,
          "abs_end_f": 3287
        },
        {
          "idx": 10,
          "text": "Then the roof dropped just two millimeters lower, squeezing the body itself.",
          "v4_start_f": 3662,
          "v4_end_f": 3833,
          "abs_start_f": 3287,
          "abs_end_f": 3441
        },
        {
          "idx": 11,
          "text": "Speed crashed to a quarter of its sprint.",
          "v4_start_f": 3833,
          "v4_end_f": 3910,
          "abs_start_f": 3441,
          "abs_end_f": 3514
        },
        {
          "idx": 12,
          "text": "Its normal three-legged running rhythm fell apart.",
          "v4_start_f": 3910,
          "v4_end_f": 4003,
          "abs_start_f": 3514,
          "abs_end_f": 3598
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "start_frame": 3607,
      "speech_start_frame": 3611,
      "speech_end_frame": 5302,
      "end_frame": 5312,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "Why did two millimeters break its stride?",
          "v4_start_f": 4099,
          "v4_end_f": 4194,
          "abs_start_f": 3611,
          "abs_end_f": 3703
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "And how was it still moving at all?",
          "v4_start_f": 4194,
          "v4_end_f": 4256,
          "abs_start_f": 3703,
          "abs_end_f": 3764
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "Follow one back leg from behind as the roof comes down.",
          "v4_start_f": 4256,
          "v4_end_f": 4380,
          "abs_start_f": 3764,
          "abs_end_f": 3883
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "With room overhead, the cockroach runs high on the tips of its feet.",
          "v4_start_f": 4380,
          "v4_end_f": 4515,
          "abs_start_f": 3883,
          "abs_end_f": 4006
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "Tiny hooked claws and soft pads catch the ground on every step.",
          "v4_start_f": 4515,
          "v4_end_f": 4649,
          "abs_start_f": 4006,
          "abs_end_f": 4138
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "Now press the ceiling down until the body flattens.",
          "v4_start_f": 4649,
          "v4_end_f": 4750,
          "abs_start_f": 4138,
          "abs_end_f": 4237
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "Forced out past eighty degrees, the leg tips sideways.",
          "v4_start_f": 4750,
          "v4_end_f": 4869,
          "abs_start_f": 4237,
          "abs_end_f": 4350
        },
        {
          "idx": 8,
          "text": "Picture trying a push-up with your arms stretched straight out to the sides.",
          "v4_start_f": 4869,
          "v4_end_f": 5008,
          "abs_start_f": 4350,
          "abs_end_f": 4481
        },
        {
          "idx": 9,
          "text": "Those foot claws lift off their normal angle.",
          "v4_start_f": 5008,
          "v4_end_f": 5099,
          "abs_start_f": 4481,
          "abs_end_f": 4571
        },
        {
          "idx": 10,
          "text": "Look higher up the leg instead, along the shin.",
          "v4_start_f": 5099,
          "v4_end_f": 5197,
          "abs_start_f": 4571,
          "abs_end_f": 4662
        },
        {
          "idx": 11,
          "text": "Rows of stiff, backward-pointing spines press straight into the floor.",
          "v4_start_f": 5197,
          "v4_end_f": 5331,
          "abs_start_f": 4662,
          "abs_end_f": 4793
        },
        {
          "idx": 12,
          "text": "As the leg drives back, those shin spines dig in like crampons.",
          "v4_start_f": 5331,
          "v4_end_f": 5469,
          "abs_start_f": 4793,
          "abs_end_f": 4923
        },
        {
          "idx": 13,
          "text": "Overhead, the rhythm shifts too.",
          "v4_start_f": 5469,
          "v4_end_f": 5548,
          "abs_start_f": 4923,
          "abs_end_f": 4993
        },
        {
          "idx": 14,
          "text": "Both middle legs often shove together like a pair of oars.",
          "v4_start_f": 5548,
          "v4_end_f": 5655,
          "abs_start_f": 4993,
          "abs_end_f": 5097
        },
        {
          "idx": 15,
          "text": "Back rubbing the roof, belly rubbing the floor, each spiny shin pushes with five times the insect's weight.",
          "v4_start_f": 5655,
          "v4_end_f": 5877,
          "abs_start_f": 5097,
          "abs_end_f": 5302
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
      "start_frame": 5312,
      "speech_start_frame": 5316,
      "speech_end_frame": 6582,
      "end_frame": 6591,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "Could the splayed feet still be helping out of sight?",
          "v4_start_f": 6012,
          "v4_end_f": 6098,
          "abs_start_f": 5316,
          "abs_end_f": 5397
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "Researchers measured leg grip without the feet engaging at all.",
          "v4_start_f": 6098,
          "v4_end_f": 6244,
          "abs_start_f": 5397,
          "abs_end_f": 5533
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "On rough ground, the spiny shins alone still locked in tight.",
          "v4_start_f": 6244,
          "v4_end_f": 6333,
          "abs_start_f": 5533,
          "abs_end_f": 5620
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "That sets up an obvious bet.",
          "v4_start_f": 6333,
          "v4_end_f": 6402,
          "abs_start_f": 5620,
          "abs_end_f": 5686
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "If shin spines need grit to catch, then a rougher floor should always make it faster.",
          "v4_start_f": 6402,
          "v4_end_f": 6585,
          "abs_start_f": 5686,
          "abs_end_f": 5852
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "Right?",
          "v4_start_f": 6585,
          "v4_end_f": 6600,
          "abs_start_f": 5852,
          "abs_end_f": 5864
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "Across more than six hundred confined runs, researchers tested slick, medium, and coarse surfaces.",
          "v4_start_f": 6600,
          "v4_end_f": 6801,
          "abs_start_f": 5864,
          "abs_end_f": 6049
        },
        {
          "idx": 8,
          "text": "Rougher ceilings always slowed the insect down.",
          "v4_start_f": 6801,
          "v4_end_f": 6901,
          "abs_start_f": 6049,
          "abs_end_f": 6146
        },
        {
          "idx": 9,
          "text": "Overhead rub only fights forward motion.",
          "v4_start_f": 6901,
          "v4_end_f": 6980,
          "abs_start_f": 6146,
          "abs_end_f": 6223
        },
        {
          "idx": 10,
          "text": "On the floor, though, the coarsest grit slowed it down too.",
          "v4_start_f": 6980,
          "v4_end_f": 7084,
          "abs_start_f": 6223,
          "abs_end_f": 6321
        },
        {
          "idx": 11,
          "text": "On slick ground, the shin spines slipped early.",
          "v4_start_f": 7084,
          "v4_end_f": 7183,
          "abs_start_f": 6321,
          "abs_end_f": 6413
        },
        {
          "idx": 12,
          "text": "On very coarse ground, the spines gripped hard, but the flattened belly snagged on every grain.",
          "v4_start_f": 7183,
          "v4_end_f": 7366,
          "abs_start_f": 6413,
          "abs_end_f": 6582
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 6,
      "start_frame": 6591,
      "speech_start_frame": 6595,
      "speech_end_frame": 8023,
      "end_frame": 8032,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "In separate compression tests, those overlapping plates took hundreds of times the cockroach's weight.",
          "v4_start_f": 7456,
          "v4_end_f": 7677,
          "abs_start_f": 6595,
          "abs_end_f": 6799
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "Brief peaks reached roughly nine hundred times its weight.",
          "v4_start_f": 7677,
          "v4_end_f": 7755,
          "abs_start_f": 6799,
          "abs_end_f": 6877
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "Spreading load across hinged plates let the insects sprint away at normal speed afterward.",
          "v4_start_f": 7755,
          "v4_end_f": 7948,
          "abs_start_f": 6877,
          "abs_end_f": 7069
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "Armor that tough, plus shins like crampons, makes it sound unstoppable.",
          "v4_start_f": 7948,
          "v4_end_f": 8070,
          "abs_start_f": 7069,
          "abs_end_f": 7183
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "So return to that narrowing doorway, across three hundred and fifteen lab attempts.",
          "v4_start_f": 8070,
          "v4_end_f": 8273,
          "abs_start_f": 7183,
          "abs_end_f": 7372
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "At wider gaps, nearly three out of four attempts shot straight through.",
          "v4_start_f": 8273,
          "v4_end_f": 8426,
          "abs_start_f": 7372,
          "abs_end_f": 7519
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "Narrow that slot to two stacked pennies, about three millimeters, and more than four out of five failed.",
          "v4_start_f": 8426,
          "v4_end_f": 8608,
          "abs_start_f": 7519,
          "abs_end_f": 7680
        },
        {
          "idx": 8,
          "text": "Only seventeen percent made it through.",
          "v4_start_f": 8608,
          "v4_end_f": 8682,
          "abs_start_f": 7680,
          "abs_end_f": 7749
        },
        {
          "idx": 9,
          "text": "Most swept the slot with their antennae, felt the squeeze, and turned back.",
          "v4_start_f": 8682,
          "v4_end_f": 8842,
          "abs_start_f": 7749,
          "abs_end_f": 7891
        },
        {
          "idx": 10,
          "text": "Nearly one in ten wedged fast at the thickest part of its chest.",
          "v4_start_f": 8842,
          "v4_end_f": 8986,
          "abs_start_f": 7891,
          "abs_end_f": 8023
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 7,
      "start_frame": 8032,
      "speech_start_frame": 8036,
      "speech_end_frame": 8920,
      "end_frame": 9008,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "idx": 1,
          "text": "Now watch that two-penny escape once more at real speed.",
          "v4_start_f": 9070,
          "v4_end_f": 9182,
          "abs_start_f": 8036,
          "abs_end_f": 8143
        },
        {
          "idx": 2,
          "text": "Antennae read the slot, stiff plates tile down on soft hinges, and spiny shins drive it clear.",
          "v4_start_f": 9182,
          "v4_end_f": 9371,
          "abs_start_f": 8143,
          "abs_end_f": 8315
        },
        {
          "idx": 3,
          "text": "Past the far edge, those folded hinges spring the shell back to half an inch.",
          "v4_start_f": 9371,
          "v4_end_f": 9572,
          "abs_start_f": 8315,
          "abs_end_f": 8502
        },
        {
          "idx": 4,
          "text": "Its feet take over the sprint again.",
          "v4_start_f": 9572,
          "v4_end_f": 9637,
          "abs_start_f": 8502,
          "abs_end_f": 8564
        },
        {
          "idx": 5,
          "text": "Solid armor would jam at the edge, and feet alone would fail inside.",
          "v4_start_f": 9637,
          "v4_end_f": 9771,
          "abs_start_f": 8564,
          "abs_end_f": 8692
        },
        {
          "idx": 6,
          "text": "It doesn't vanish under a door by being indestructible.",
          "v4_start_f": 9771,
          "v4_end_f": 9881,
          "abs_start_f": 8692,
          "abs_end_f": 8797
        },
        {
          "idx": 7,
          "text": "It gets through because its shell can fold, and its shins can walk.",
          "v4_start_f": 9881,
          "v4_end_f": 10017,
          "abs_start_f": 8797,
          "abs_end_f": 8920
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
